# Task 2312 (panel 235's R3, R19): the program's catalogue is the build list,
# holding every package of the build. The catalogue of `alpha` names
# `gamma`, and the program's names no entry for that package, so `alpha`
# cannot be read and the `use` that reaches it is refused at its line.
use <alpha>/a  #~ package_unread

function main()
    print(a.one().to_str())
